{"speciesId":418,"names":{"fr":"Mustébouée","es":"Buizel","en":"Buizel","ja":"ブイゼル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a flotation sac that is like an inflatable collar. It floats on water with its head out."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It swims by rotating its two tails like a screw. When it dives, its flotation sac collapses."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It inflates its flotation sac, keeping its face above water in order to watch for prey movement."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It inflates its flotation sac, keeping its face above water in order to watch for prey movement."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il utilise ses deux queues comme une hélice pour se propulser sous l’eau et trancher les algues."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il utilise ses deux queues comme une hélice pour se propulser sous l’eau et trancher les algues."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il nage en faisant tournoyer ses deux queues comme une hélice. Sa bouée s’affaisse quand il plonge."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Nada rotando sus dos colas a modo de tornillo. Cuando bucea, el flotador se pliega."},{"langua